  aciklama: "8. kat, daire 4, Y\xF6netim dairesi (asans\xF6r). Sekiz kilit: banyo
    (mente\u015Fe), kiler (anahtar banyoda), Oda B (kilerin kolu), mutfak (anahtar
    alet \xE7antas\u0131nda), salon (k\u0131r\u0131k anahtar: sand\u0131k + buzdolab\u0131),
    Oda A (\u015Fifre 1974, salondaki isk\xE2n ruhsat\u0131), dosya dolab\u0131 (anahtar
    komodinde), asans\xF6r (sigorta dolapta; panoya tak\u0131l\u0131r, \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131l\u0131r,
    g\xF6sterge 9 der) -> kabinde \xE7at\u0131 anahtar\u0131."
